source_version

or field-level provenance.

At MVP level, Company data is considered declarative/user-provided unless otherwise explicitly established by a future contract.

33. INSEE / INPI Integration Boundary

FC-08 is architecturally compatible with future retrieval from:

INSEE
INPI
official company referentials

